.venv
.vscode
.session_logs
session_logs
.session_backups
__pycache__
data
# The authoring sources (.docx/.rtf) and their screenshots stay out; the
# PDFs are the deliverable and ship inside the installer, so they are
# tracked. Written as documentation/* rather than documentation, because
# git will not descend into an excluded directory and a negation inside
# one has no effect.
documentation/*
!documentation/*.pdf
# And the Markdown sources, from 5 September 2026. The Design Overview moved
# onto md_to_rtf.py with the Phase 6a rewrite, so its .md is now the source
# the .rtf and the .pdf are generated from, and a *source* with no history is
# worse than the hand-authored artefact it replaced. The generated .rtf stays
# ignored, beside the .docx that always was.
!documentation/*.md
*.txt
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
*.tex
!tests/fixtures/**/*.tex
*.zip
*.png
!icons/*.png
*.log
.pytest_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
build
dist
dist_installer
